{"title":"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is a solution of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdce916001563498c99940bf2b0d1a940c0e5d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$qx - 3 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/5/d556cbe54ee572f525de2e5cb3aa0b1e537205bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 14 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ -7 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"441\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Plugging_in_First.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Plugging_in_First)\">Solution 1 (Plugging in First)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Plugging in First)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into the equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/5/425a4b6bca88544f3b44b2c7b0a97a9a16a8a02a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2q - 3 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e9c1ddeb08d37fc4ce286f6f8933fa38efdd2e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2q = 11 + 3 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a77b0ca5b1779cd90a7b90442d15966149a011b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = \\frac{14}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Plugging_in_After.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Plugging_in_After)\">Solution 2 (Plugging in After)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Plugging in After)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdce916001563498c99940bf2b0d1a940c0e5d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$qx - 3 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/f/e7f05c1713986cdd8d63e0a925588003442e6653.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$qx = 11 + 3 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db2f2c5513d0fb477666434c23b51216a9e164e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = \\frac{14}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we then see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a77b0ca5b1779cd90a7b90442d15966149a011b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = \\frac{14}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley\">1998 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Prob